   },
   "evidence": "At head, app.ts exposes `get gateExecutor() { return factory.deps.gateExecutor; }`. Land checks independently read `this.deps.gateExecutor` for the initial execution (queue.ts:808), retry (829), and fresh-checkout policy (833). Reload can therefore change both execution location and setup policy between attempts. At base, app.ts supplied the fixed value `gateExecutor: this.deps.gateExecutor`, so those reads retained the original executor. The probe used a fake initial LAN result, an actual reload, and the real local retry path; repository export and ownership bookkeeping were mocked."
